complete_reproduction_plan:
  paper_info:
    title: "RICE: Refining via Critical State Explanation for Reinforcement Learning"
    core_contribution: "A method that uses an explanation mask network to identify critical states in a trained RL agent, then refines the agent by training from a mixed initial state distribution (blending default starts and critical states) with an exploration bonus (RND). The mask network is trained efficiently via an intrinsic reward, avoiding the complex optimization of prior explanation methods."

